    },
    {
      "displayText": "要開始拍攝了！\n能請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓開一下嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981958B59CB62CD651D4E86FF01000A80FD8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B93958B4E004E0B55CEFF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯？那個超級環……\n看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是個挺有來頭的寶可夢訓練家啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF1F90A3500B8D857D1A74B020262026000A770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F500B633A67094F86982D76845BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6554A300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實我……是一名\n只有內行人才知道的電影導演。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE6621120262026662F4E00540D000A53EA67095167884C4EBA624D77E59053768496FB5F715C0E6F14300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要用手機洛托姆\n寫實地拍攝密阿雷的野生寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389817528624B6A5F6D1B625859C6000A5BEB5BE6573062CD651D5BC6963F96F7768491CE751F5BF653EF5922300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我相中了會用\n銳利牙齒襲擊獵物的凶暴的寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……利牙魚！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F621176F84E2D4E8667037528000A92B3522972599F52897264CA73757269768451F666B476845BF653EF592200100001BE00000A20262026522972599B5AFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是要直接拍攝野生寶可夢，\n說實在的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F898176F463A562CD651D91CE751F5BF653EF5922FF0C000A8AAA5BE6572876842026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很危險！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88537196AAFF01FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，我想拜託\n某個人的寶可夢幫忙拍攝啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C621160F362DC8A17000A67D0500B4EBA76845BF653EF59225E6B5FD962CD651D5566300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著利牙魚的話，\n請務必幫忙拍攝！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF015982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E368457522972599B5A76848A71FF0C000A8ACB52D95FC55E6B5FD962CD651DFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
